  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Spirit Manipulation — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>Once you reach 3rd level, your Cursed Energy increases the power of your Cursed Spirits in the following ways:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Their Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution scores will gain a bonus equal to your Cursed Energy modifier.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>They regain all HP at the end of a short rest.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>They become immune to the frightened or charmed condition.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Regardless of distance, you'll know if your cursed spirits were exorcised.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In addition, as a reaction for x Cursed Energy you can sacrifice a cursed spirit in exchange for reducing incoming damage by xd20, with x being the CR of the creature sacrificed in the process.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
